      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LEONARD WILSON KEENAN ESTATE & LETTING AGENTS Our business is you.. STUNNING 1 BED / 1 BATH EARLY VIEWING STRONGLY ADVISED Richard Todd and the Leonard Wilson Keenan team are truly delighted to present this property to the D. 8 property market. No. 24 Traders Wharf , Ushers Quay is sure to impress first time buyers, investors, and parties trading down alike. The spacious floor plan consists of: Entrance hall, Kitchen/dining/living room , The Large double bedroom of the property and bathroom. The many features of this lovely home include: Contemporary fitted kitchen with an abundance of base and eye level storage to include all integrated appliances, fitted wardrobes in the bedroom and quality tiling & sanitary ware in the bathroom. There is a fantastic array of local amenities literally on the doorstep including bars, restaurants and shops, with the Four Courts, O' Connell Street, Grafton Street and Temple Bar just a short stroll away. The Luas and Heuston Station are also within close proximity.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
